BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Durham Parks & Recreation
DESCRIPTION:The Geminid Meteor Shower is the most prolific meteor shower of
  the year with up to 120 meteors per hour. Join us in the meadow at the We
 st Point on the Eno Environmental Education Pavilion as we watch the spect
 acle. Enjoy a cup of hot chocolate while lying on a blanket under the star
 s. No cost\, but please register in advance. Please note that this program
  is weather dependent. https://www.dprplaymore.org/calendar.aspx?EID=7055
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261213T235900
DTSTAMP;TZID=America/New_York:20261105T113222
