LAST-MODIFIED;TZID=America/New_York:20261105T113222
LOCATION:<p>West Point on the Eno &gt\; Environmental Education Pavilion</p
 > - 5253 N Roxboro Street  Durham NC 27712
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Geminid's Meteor Shower
UID:7055
URL:/common/modules/iCalendar/iCalendar.aspx?feed=calendar&catID=22
END:VEVENT
